Let's plug $\blueD{x=-0.5}$, $\maroonD{y=3}$, and $\goldD{\dfrac{dx}{dt}=-6}$ into the equation we obtained:

$\begin{align}
24\blueD{x}\cdot\goldD{\dfrac{dx}{dt}}&=3\maroonD{y}^2\cdot\dfrac{dy}{dt}
\\\\
24(\blueD{-0.5})(\goldD{-6})&=3\cdot\maroonD{3}^2\cdot\dfrac{dy}{dt}
\\\\
72&=27\cdot\dfrac{dy}{dt}
\\\\
\dfrac{8}{3}&=\dfrac{dy}{dt}
\end{align}$
